  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Urban Development - Bar Municipality</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Engagement Facility formalizes the strategic partnership between the Municipality of Bar and UNDP to advance sustainable, inclusive, and forward-looking local development. It provides a platform for co-creating initiatives focused on the valorisation of cultural heritage as a driver of local economic development and community engagement, as well as on strengthening municipal capacities for integrated planning and delivery of green, smart, and citizen-centred services. The Facility supports the development of participatory, gender-responsive, and climate-resilient solutions, aligned with modern urban planning approaches and long-term development priorities.</narrative>
  </description>
